<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE concept PUBLIC "-//OASIS//DTD DITA 1.3 Concept//EN" "concept.dtd">
<concept base="Anywhere" id="t00658">
	<title>Resuming Smart Cruise Control</title>
	<conbody>
		<table colsep="1" frame="none" outputclass="formatc_none" rowsep="1" id="e02304">
			<tgroup cols="2" colsep="0" rowsep="1">
				<colspec colname="col1" colnum="1" colsep="0" colwidth="50*"/>
				<colspec colname="col2" colnum="2" colsep="0" colwidth="50*"/>
				<tbody>
					<row rowsep="1">
						<entry colname="col1">
							<fig id="e02305">
								<figgroup>
									<image align="center" href="../../images/N_CT25E049_3.eps" scale="95" placement="break"/>
								</figgroup>
							</fig>
						</entry>
						<entry colname="col2">
							<ul id="e02306">
								<li>
									<p>To resume Smart Cruise Control after the function was canceled, operate the (<image align="left" href="../../images/WKIA_334.eps" scale="15" placement="inline"/>), (<image align="left" href="../../images/WKIA_335.eps" scale="15" placement="inline"/>) or (<image align="left" href="../../images/WKIA_079.eps" scale="15" placement="inline"/>) switch.</p>
								</li>
								<li>
									<p>If you push the (<image align="left" href="../../images/WKIA_334.eps" scale="15" placement="inline"/>) switch up or (<image align="left" href="../../images/WKIA_335.eps" scale="15" placement="inline"/>) switch down, the set speed will be set to the current speed on the cluster.</p>
								</li>
								<li>
									<p>If you press the (<image align="left" href="../../images/WKIA_079.eps" scale="15" placement="inline"/>) switch, vehicle speed will resume to the preset speed.</p>
								</li>
							</ul>
						</entry>
					</row>
				</tbody>
			</tgroup>
		</table>
		<note type="warning">
			<p>Check the driving condition before using the (<image align="left" href="../../images/WKIA_079.eps" scale="15" placement="inline"/>) switch. Driving speed may sharply increase or decrease when you press the (<image align="left" href="../../images/WKIA_079.eps" scale="15" placement="inline"/>) switch.</p>
		</note>
	</conbody>
</concept>